        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: آینده",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "آینده — âyande — \"next, coming; the future\". The future uses خواهم with the verb's past stem (رفت from رفتن): هفته آینده به مشهد خواهم رفت — hafte-ye âyande be mashhad khâham raft — \"Next week I will go to Mashhad.\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "âyande is ây-, the present stem of âmadan, \"to come\" (EtymDB), with -ande, \"-ing\": \"coming\". The verb is inherited."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
